  "html": "<table>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:335px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/FIR.jpg\" title=\"FIR.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"518\" src=\"/images/FIR.jpg\" width=\"333\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/FIR.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><b>Frump's Interdungeonal Resort can be accessed through a portal from <a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">The Widower's Nest</a> Level 5 or a one way portal from <a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">Widow Maker's Lair</a>.  A portal leads out to <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a> Level 1.  There is also an Obelisk which will allow you to return once you use it.</b>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"NPC.27s\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">NPC's</span></h2>\n<p>The following NPC's, all Quest givers, are to be found here:\n</p>\n<ul><li> <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Nielsen\" title=\"Nielsen\">Nielsen</a>\n</li><li> <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Taxman_Jones\" title=\"Taxman Jones\">Taxman Jones</a>\n</li><li> <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Chuck_McBarris\" title=\"Chuck McBarris\">Chuck McBarris</a>\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Junior_Exec_Ivan\" title=\"Junior Exec Ivan\">Junior Exec Ivan</a>\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
